    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9915" root="خبز" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَبِيزٌ</span></b>  Bread <i>made</i> [or <i>kneaded and baked</i>], (K,
TA,) of whatever grain it be. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also
<i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَرِيد</span> [Bread <i>crumbled or broken, and moistened with broth</i>]. (Sgh, K.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُبْزَةٌ</span>.]
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also a vulgar term for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَبِيصَةٌ</span>. (Esh-Shereeshee, in Har p. 21.)

